  "contentHtml": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Would you want to start a company in Dubai based on your professional knowledge and entrepreneurial skills? As the world’s most significant commercial city, Dubai&nbsp;generally has a lot to offer businesses as part of its fast-paced economy and significant interest in professional services.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">However, one needs to acquire a&nbsp;professional license to enter this industry. This license merely&nbsp;gives you access to the market and demonstrates Dubai’s dedication to nurturing talent and innovation. This detailed article covers everything, from the prerequisites and permissible </span>professional license activities in Dubai<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to the expenses and application procedure for obtaining the permits.</span></p>\n<div class=\"lwptoc lwptoc-autoWidth lwptoc-baseItems lwptoc-light lwptoc-notInherit\" data-smooth-scroll=\"1\" data-smooth-scroll-offset=\"24\"><div class=\"lwptoc_i\">    <div class=\"lwptoc_header\">\n        <b class=\"lwptoc_title\">Contents</b>                    <span class=\"lwptoc_toggle\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"lwptoc_toggle_label\" data-label=\"show\">hide</a>            </span>\n            </div>\n<div class=\"lwptoc_items lwptoc_items-visible\">\n    <div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\"><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Professional_License_in_Dubai-Introduction\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Professional License in Dubai-Introduction</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#What_Business_Types_Acquire_a_Dubai_Professional_License\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">What Business Types Acquire a Dubai Professional License?</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Explore_Authorized_Business_Activities_with_a_Dubai_Professional_License\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Explore Authorized Business Activities with a Dubai Professional License:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Premium_Features_of_Dubai_Professional_License\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Premium Features of Dubai Professional License:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Seamless_Process_to_Get_a_Dubai_Professional_License\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Seamless Process to Get a Dubai Professional License:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Estimated_Costs_of_Dubai_Professional_Licenses\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Estimated Costs of Dubai Professional Licenses</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Consult_with_KPM_PRO_for_Your_Dubai_Professional_License\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Consult with KPM PRO for Your Dubai Professional License</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Final_Words\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Final Words</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#FAQs\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">FAQs:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div></div></div>\n</div></div><h2 id=\"professional-license-in-dubai-introduction\"><b>Professional License in Dubai-Introduction</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A professional license in Dubai allows you to perform various professions and conduct business in Dubai, as opposed to commercial and <a href=\"/industrial-license/\">industrial licenses</a>, mostly for trading and production.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The DED authority&nbsp;provides a professional license in Dubai. It is appropriate for persons working in fields as varied as information technology, medical care, legal assistance, and artisans who make handcrafted goods and offer professional&nbsp;services. This </span><a href=\"/trade-license-in-dubai/\">trade license in Dubai</a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is appropriate if your credentials, experience, and professional degree are relevant to the services provided, with lower administrative expenses than other licenses.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"what-business-types-acquire-a-dubai-professional-license\"><b>What Business Types Acquire a Dubai Professional License?</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The UAE offers various </span><a href=\"/types-of-trade-license/\">types of trade licenses</a> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">for businesses.</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">However, People and companies involved in specialized, service-based operations need a professional license. Typical instances consist of:</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b>Business Consultancy:</b> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Management, technology, constitutional, marketing, and administrative experts. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b>Contractors:</b> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Writers, designers, and programmers, among others.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b>Instructors And Coaches: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Presenting educational programs or specialized training lessons.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b>Professionals in Creative Arts:</b> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Creators of art, designers,&nbsp;photographers, and event organizers.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The regular </span><a href=\"/general-trading-license/\">general trading license</a> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">covers retail businesses.</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The professional license is perfect for qualified experts hoping to build a name in their sector. Visit the DED website for a full list of professional licensing activities in Dubai.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"explore-authorized-business-activities-with-a-dubai-professional-license\"><b>Explore Authorized Business Activities with a Dubai Professional License:</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A professional license in Dubai lets people or companies operate in several specialized sectors. The </span>DED professional license activities list <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">is fully outlined below:</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"corporate-counsel\"><b>Corporate Counsel:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Uses managerial operations, economic analysis, market study, and strategic planning to let companies reach objectives and increase effectiveness.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"management-consultation\"><b>Management Consultation:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emphasizes organizational growth, dealing with change, human resources assistance, and offering solutions for improved managerial techniques.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"information-technology-consultancy\"><b>Information Technology Consultancy:</b></h3>\n<p>Professional license activities in Dubai<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> cover systems integration, cybersecurity, and software development to upgrade the technological foundation of a company.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"legal-advice\"><b>Legal Advice:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It provides legal consultation, contract preparation, and conflict resolution services for businesses and individuals.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"fiscal-consultancy\"><b>Fiscal Consultancy:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It offers risk management, financial strategies, and capital investment guidance to let companies and people handle their money.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"illustrations-and-design\"><b>Illustrations and Design:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It focuses on visual interaction, branding, and graphic design to produce strong corporate identities.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"web-designing\"><b>Web Designing:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It covers website designing and development, e-commerce services, and online promotional instruments to show and improve online presence.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"interior-design-services\"><b>Interior Design Services:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It provides pleasant and valuable environments by covering home and business interior design services.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"design-in-architecture\"><b>Design in Architecture:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Providing architectural options entails planning, designing, and effective project management.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"fashion-and-style\"><b>Fashion and Style:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It provides textile design services, fashion accessories, and apparel, producing distinctive and trendy products.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"auditing-and-financial-accounting\"><b>Auditing and Financial Accounting:</b></h3>\n<p>Professional license activities in Dubai<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> also cover internal audits, tax adherence, and financial reporting to guarantee legal conformity and correctness.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"legal-consultancy\"><b>Legal Consultancy:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It offers legal information, dispute resolution help, and legal representation for people and companies alike.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"medical-resources\"><b>Medical Resources:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It covers healthcare practice, medical consultancy, research, and development to assist in the treatment of patients and improvements in the healthcare industry.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"education-and-learning\"><b>Education and Learning:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It offers instructional consultation, tutoring, and teaching to assist learning and growth.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"engineering-and-technology\"><b>Engineering and Technology:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Designs, builds, and innovatively combines civil, mechanical, electrical, chemical engineering, and technology.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"beauty-well-being\"><b>Beauty &amp; Well-being:</b></h3>\n<p>Professional license activities in Dubai<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> promote health and well-being by covering beauty&nbsp;salons, spas, and fitness centers’ offerings.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"linguistic-services-and-interpretation\"><b>Linguistic Services and Interpretation:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They offer language interpretation and translation to help with multilingual communication.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"public-relations-and-advertising\"><b>Public Relations and Advertising:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They employ brand management, promotional techniques, and public relations initiatives to improve brand image.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"leadership-and-planning\"><b>Leadership and Planning:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They address planning, coordination, and execution for a multitude of events.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"editing-and-writing\"><b>Editing and Writing:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It includes developing technical material, content creation, and editing to precisely convey expertise in technology.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please be aware: The professional activity will affect the criteria; this </span>professional license Dubai activities list<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is not all-inclusive. Find professionals for&nbsp;business setup consultancy&nbsp;to fulfill&nbsp;your company’s licensing needs.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"premium-features-of-dubai-professional-license\"><b>Premium Features of Dubai Professional License:</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Customized service-oriented companies in Dubai would be suited for a professional license. Let’s examine its unique qualities.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"complete-business-ownership\"><b>Complete Business Ownership:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It offers complete foreign ownership for businesses.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"multiple-business-activities\"><b>Multiple Business Activities:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It offers multiple professional activities, like business consultancy, legal advisory, information technology, and online learning.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"professional-license-cost\"><b>Professional License Cost:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It costs less than another business setup, typically beginning at ten thousand AED.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"feasibility-for-visa-sponsorship\"><b>Feasibility for Visa Sponsorship:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is feasible to acquire a residency visa and be allowed to sponsor your dependents.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"workspace-requirements\"><b>Workspace Requirements:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It must acquire a physical or virtual workspace to provide the registered address.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"favorable-legal-framework\"><b>Favorable Legal Framework:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It provides a simplified legislative framework without hectic complications.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"market-accessibility\"><b>Market Accessibility:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It offers direct and smooth accessibility to the UAE’s dynamic market and business environment.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"smooth-and-flexible\"><b>Smooth and Flexible:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It offers maximum flexibility and smooth continuity for business operations in the region.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"no-minimum-funds-criteria\"><b>No Minimum Funds Criteria:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No mandatory capital investment and mutual funds are required.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"best-suitable-for\"><b>Best Suitable for:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is ideal for business consultants, skilled professionals, and specific service providers.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"seamless-process-to-get-a-dubai-professional-license\"><b>Seamless Process to Get a Dubai Professional License:</b></h2>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-8597 aligncenter\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Seamless-Process-to-Get-a-Dubai-Professional-License-300x150.png\" alt=\"Seamless Process to Get a Dubai Professional License\" width=\"788\" height=\"394\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-8597 aligncenter\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Seamless-Process-to-Get-a-Dubai-Professional-License-300x150.png\" alt=\"Seamless Process to Get a Dubai Professional License\" width=\"788\" height=\"394\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Seamless-Process-to-Get-a-Dubai-Professional-License-300x150.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Seamless-Process-to-Get-a-Dubai-Professional-License-1024x512.png 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Seamless-Process-to-Get-a-Dubai-Professional-License-768x384.png 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Seamless-Process-to-Get-a-Dubai-Professional-License.png 1032w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 788px) 100vw, 788px\"></noscript></p>\n<p><b>Find Your Corporate Activity:</b> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check that the DED authority&nbsp;of Dubai approves your professional sector.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b>Determine The Business&nbsp;Structure:</b> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose a single proprietorship or an administrative corporation, depending on ownership requirements.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b>Trade Name&nbsp;Authorization:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Select an approved company name adhering to UAE trade&nbsp;name&nbsp;guidelines.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b>Compile Necessary Documentation:</b> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Provide required&nbsp;documents to the DED, including evidence of credentials and business ideas.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b>Lease A Workspace:</b> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If necessary, provide a leasing agreement or choose a virtual office instead.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b>Submitting Final Applications:</b> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Provide&nbsp;finalized paperwork, get clearance, and pay license costs.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"estimated-costs-of-dubai-professional-licenses\"><b>Estimated Costs of Dubai Professional Licenses</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional license prices start&nbsp;from ten thousand&nbsp;to thirty thousand&nbsp;AED. The government charges these costs for handling your license application. The specific license type, the selected site, such as mainland, free zone, or offshore, and the company activity will all affect the costs of licenses. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Consider&nbsp;the most reliable&nbsp;Dubai business creation professionals to receive a complete cost analysis and tailored recommendations. They can help you save unnecessary expenditures and effectively complete the licensing procedure.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The following are the main expenses of launching a company in Dubai:</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b></b></p>\n<p><b>Initial license approval Cost:&nbsp;</b></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One thousand to three thousand&nbsp;AED. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b></b></p>\n<p><b>Trade Name Registration&nbsp;Cost:&nbsp;</b></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Six hundred and twenty&nbsp;AED. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b></b></p>\n<p><b>Composing and Notarizing Company&nbsp;MOA:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Two thousand to four thousand&nbsp;AED. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b></b></p>\n<p><b>License Issuance Price:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ten to fifteen thousand&nbsp;AED. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><b></b></p>\n<p><b>Workspace Leasing Expense (based on business size and location):&nbsp;</b></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Twenty to fifty thousand&nbsp;AED.</span></p>\n<p><b>Visa Fee:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visa costs range from three to five thousand&nbsp;AED.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Based on numerous criteria, the cost of launching a professional firm in Dubai may run from thirty-five to eighty thousand&nbsp;AED&nbsp;overall.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"consult-with-kpm-pro-for-your-dubai-professional-license\"><b>Consult with KPM PRO for Your Dubai Professional License</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Every field may have specific criteria, so diligent research and direction from local authorities are rather important. With the correct strategy, your career goals will materialize in Dubai. <a href=\"/contact-us/\">Contact </a></span>KPM PRO<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to acquire your Dubai professional license.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"final-words\"><b>Final Words</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Getting a Dubai&nbsp;professional license&nbsp;is a strategic&nbsp;procedure for business owners wishing to leverage the expanding&nbsp;market of the Emirate. A smooth business&nbsp;setup depends on specific&nbsp;knowledge of the legal&nbsp;procedure and related expenses. With meticulous company establishment expertise in Dubai, </span><a href=\"/\">KPMPRO</a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is here to simplify your path. Get started on your professional license application by contacting us now, and start your company in one of the world’s&nbsp;most vibrant cities.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"faqs\"><strong>FAQs:</strong></h2>\n<h3 id=\"what-is-a-professional-license-in-dubai\"><b>What is a Professional License in Dubai?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A Professional License in Dubai allows individuals/companies to offer specialized, service-based activities. The activities like consultancy, education, healthcare, or IT all fall under it.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"what-types-of-activities-fall-under-a-professional-license\"><b>What types of activities fall under a Professional License?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Under a professional license, the activities include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Management consultancy</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Legal advisory</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Engineering, accounting</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">IT services</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Education</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Beauty and wellness, and</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Other professional or creative services.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"what-documents-are-required-to-apply-for-a-professional-license\"><b>What documents are required to apply for a Professional License?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For a professional license, you’ll need a:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Passport copy</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visa or Emirates ID</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trade name approval</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tenancy contract</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Qualification certificates, and</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Completed DED application forms.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"how-much-does-a-professional-license-cost-in-dubai\"><b>How much does a Professional License cost in Dubai?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Typically, the cost ranges from 10,000 to 30,000 Dirhams. The cost depends on business activity, location, and government approval fees.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"what-are-the-renewal-requirements-for-a-professional-license\"><b>What are the renewal requirements for a Professional License?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To renew a professional license, submit the valid tenancy contract, payment voucher, and updated documents. Submit to the DED before the license expiry date.</span></p>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What is a Professional License in Dubai?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"A Professional License in Dubai allows individuals/companies to offer specialized, service-based activities. The activities like consultancy, education, healthcare, or IT all fall under it.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What types of activities fall under a Professional License?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Under a professional license, the activities include:</p>\n<p>Management consultancy\nLegal advisory\nEngineering, accounting\nIT services\nEducation\nBeauty and wellness, and\nOther professional or creative services.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What documents are required to apply for a Professional License?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"For a professional license, you’ll need a:</p>\n<p>Passport copy\nVisa or Emirates ID\nTrade name approval\nTenancy contract\nQualification certificates, and\nCompleted DED application forms.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How much does a Professional License cost in Dubai?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Typically, the cost ranges from 10,000 to 30,000 Dirhams. The cost depends on business activity, location, and government approval fees.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What are the renewal requirements for a Professional License?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"To renew a professional license, submit the valid tenancy contract, payment voucher, and updated documents. Submit to the DED before the license expiry date.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script><!-- Simple Share Buttons Adder (8.5.6) simplesharebuttons.com --></p>\n<div class=\"ssba-modern-2 ssba ssbp-wrap aligncenter ssbp--theme-8\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<ul class=\"ssbp-list\">\n<li class=\"ssbp-li--facebook\"><a data-site=\"facebook\" class=\"ssba_facebook_share ssba_share_link ssbp-